Hi,

Thank you for reaching out, and I'd be happy to help you find the right
software for your HOLOFAN 11.8" 3D Hologram Fan.

Since your unit uses .BIN video files and a .SET configuration file, it may
be an earlier model that works with a different version of our software
than the one currently available.

To confirm the correct software for your unit, could you please send me
your order number, or the email address used for the purchase? Once I have
that, I'll check which version is compatible and get back to you.

If you're able to include a photo of the back of the fan showing the label
or model number, that would also help.

Rhea L.

